  "plan": "docs/plans/2026-07-12-convergencia-produto-arquitetura-implementation-plan.md",
  "note": "During the convergence milestone, no new primary creative destinations or creative pipelines may be introduced. Anything not on this list is rejected until Gate 8 lifts the freeze.",
